STATEMENT: >>>
An author writes a root, a legend card, tabs, screens and cards with sdoc new NARRATIVE, giving each its WIDGET, PLACE and, where a figure draws over other narratives, its Over target. The task renders it. No file under docs/sdoc/view changes.
